        "result": "The question hangs in the air. {t.name} never brings it up with you again." }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "speak_out", "title": "Me too", "content": [ "sexual_violence" ],
    "text": "Everyone is sharing their stories online. Two words, over and over. You have a story too.",
